<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>OAuth Callback Captured — Zoho PoC</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: #0d1117; color: #e6edf3;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh; padding: 24px 16px;
  }
  .container { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .banner {
    background: rgba(255,68,68,0.12); border: 2px solid #ff4444;
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .banner-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #ff4444; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .banner-sub { color: #8b949e; font-size: 13px; }
  .card {
    background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d;
    border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .card-header {
    background: #21262d; border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
    padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    color: #8b949e; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .card-body { padding: 16px; }
  .data-row {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; font-size: 13px; align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .data-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .data-key {
    color: #58a6ff; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px;
    min-width: 140px; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .data-val { color: #e6edf3; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; word-break: break-all; }
  .data-val.red { color: #ff4444; font-weight: 700; }
  .data-val.green { color: #3fb950; font-weight: 700; }
  .data-val.amber { color: #ffa657; }
  .param-block {
    background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d;
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; margin-top: 8px;
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px;
  }
  .param-line { padding: 3px 0; }
  .pk { color: #58a6ff; } .peq { color: #8b949e; } .pv { color: #ffa657; word-break: break-all; }
  .impact {
    background: rgba(255,68,68,0.08); border: 1px solid #ff4444;
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .impact strong { color: #ff4444; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px; }
  .impact ul { padding-left: 18px; line-height: 2; color: #e6edf3; }
  footer { margin-top: 24px; text-align: center; color: #484f58; font-size: 11px; }
  .big-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(255,68,68,0.15); border: 1px solid #ff4444;
    color: #ff4444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff4444;
    animation: pulse 1.2s infinite; display: inline-block; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:0.2} }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <div class="banner">
    <div class="banner-title">🎯 OAuth Callback Hijacked!</div>
    <div class="banner-sub">Zoho sent its OAuth /oauthorize callback to this attacker-controlled server</div>
  </div>

  <div class="big-badge"><span class="dot"></span> LIVE — Zoho OAuth callback received on attacker domain</div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">🔗 Redirect + OAuth Callback Evidence</div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">document.referrer</span>
        <span class="data-val green" id="referrer">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">Attacker URL hit</span>
        <span class="data-val red" id="current-url">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">OAuth path called</span>
        <span class="data-val red" id="pathname">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">Timestamp</span>
        <span class="data-val" id="ts">—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">📦 Parameters Received from Zoho</div>
    <div class="card-body" id="params-body">
      <span style="color:#8b949e;font-size:13px">Loading...</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">🖥️ Victim Info</div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">User-Agent</span>
        <span class="data-val amber" id="ua">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">Language</span>
        <span class="data-val" id="lang">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">Platform</span>
        <span class="data-val" id="plat">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">Screen</span>
        <span class="data-val" id="scr">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="data-row">
        <span class="data-key">URL Hash</span>
        <span class="data-val" id="hash">—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="impact">
    <strong>⚠️ Critical Impact — What attacker can do:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Intercept Zoho OAuth <code>/oauthorize</code> callback on attacker's domain</li>
      <li>Capture <code>state</code> parameter (may contain session/auth data)</li>
      <li>Serve fake Zoho login page to re-steal credentials</li>
      <li>Complete OAuth flow on behalf of victim</li>
      <li>Referrer header leaks: victim came from <code>accounts.zoho.com</code></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Security Research PoC — Authorized Bug Bounty Testing<br>
    Researcher: binodchandrabissoyi@gmail.com | Target: accounts.zoho.com (Zoho Bug Bounty Program)
  </footer>
</div>
<script>
  function esc(s){ return s.replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;'); }

  document.getElementById('referrer').textContent = document.referrer || '(none / referrer policy blocked)';
  document.getElementById('current-url').textContent = window.location.href;
  document.getElementById('pathname').textContent = window.location.pathname;
  document.getElementById('ts').textContent = new Date().toISOString() + ' UTC';
  document.getElementById('ua').textContent = navigator.userAgent;
  document.getElementById('lang').textContent = navigator.language;
  document.getElementById('plat').textContent = navigator.platform || 'unknown';
  document.getElementById('scr').textContent = screen.width + 'x' + screen.height;
  document.getElementById('hash').textContent = window.location.hash || '(none)';

  var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  var pb = document.getElementById('params-body');
  var entries = [...params];
  if(entries.length === 0){
    pb.innerHTML = '<span style="color:#8b949e;font-size:13px">No query parameters found.</span>';
  } else {
    var html = '<div class="param-block">';
    entries.forEach(function([k,v]){
      var decoded = '';
      try { decoded = decodeURIComponent(v); } catch(e){ decoded = v; }
      html += '<div class="param-line"><span class="pk">'+esc(k)+'</span>'
            + '<span class="peq"> = </span>'
            + '<span class="pv">'+esc(decoded)+'</span></div>';
      if(decoded !== v){
        html += '<div class="param-line" style="padding-left:16px;color:#484f58;font-size:11px">raw: '+esc(v)+'</div>';
      }
    });
    html += '</div>';
    pb.innerHTML = html;
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
